{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Let us consider a wind turbine. Suppose the available power in the wind is 500 megawatts and the useful electrical power output is 120 megawatts. We use the power form of the efficiency equation. Divide 120 by 500 to obtain 0.24. Multiply by one hundred to obtain 24 per cent. The turbine's efficiency is 24 per cent under these stated conditions. Notice that megawatts measure power, not energy. If we were given energy in megajoules instead, we would use the energy form of the same ratio.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": false}", "duration": 37.992, "words": [["Let", 0.102083], ["us", 0.3495], ["consider", 0.531791], ["a", 0.948458], ["wind", 1.091666], ["turbine.", 1.313041], ["Suppose", 2.64325], ["the", 3.112], ["available", 3.190125], ["power", 3.710958], ["in", 4.0495], ["the", 4.20575], ["wind", 4.348958], ["is", 4.544291], ["500", 4.713541], ["megawatts", 5.338541], ["and", 5.950541], ["the", 6.09375], ["useful", 6.197916], ["electrical", 6.601583], ["power", 7.213541], ["output", 7.578125], ["is", 8.072916], ["120", 8.216166], ["megawatts.", 9.166666], ["We", 10.76825], ["use", 10.989583], ["the", 11.171875], ["power", 11.328125], ["form", 11.588541], ["of", 11.822916], ["the", 11.979166], ["efficiency", 12.083333], ["equation.", 12.760416], ["Divide", 14.21875], ["120", 14.661458], ["by", 15.716166], ["500", 15.872416], ["to", 16.5495], ["obtain", 16.70575], ["0.24.", 17.109375], ["Multiply", 19.101583], ["by", 19.778666], ["one", 19.960958], ["hundred", 20.169291], ["to", 20.533875], ["obtain", 20.690125], ["24", 21.106791], ["per", 21.32554098], ["cent.", 21.65366595], ["The", 23.203125], ["turbine's", 23.4245], ["efficiency", 23.802083], ["is", 24.427083], ["24", 24.609375], ["per", 24.829291444444443], ["cent", 25.15916611111111], ["under", 25.651041], ["these", 25.9245], ["stated", 26.054708], ["conditions.", 26.523458], ["Notice", 28.177083], ["that", 28.658875], ["megawatts", 28.880208], ["m